#ASSERT `offence under s 404` `s 404 illus, the servant`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 404` `s 404 illus, the servant`)'s punishment EQUALS "imprisonment for a term which may extend to 3 years, and shall also be liable to fine; and if the offender at the time of such person's decease was employed by him as a clerk or servant, the imprisonment may extend to 7 years"
#ASSERT `punishment prescribed by s 404, clerk or servant`'s `maximum term in months` EQUALS JUST 84
#ASSERT `punishment prescribed by s 404`'s `maximum term in months` EQUALS JUST 36

§ `Criminal breach of trust - ss 405-409`

@@FIX `a breach of trust` : CBT Facts
