-- s 427 illus (c): damage to a power station likely to disrupt a key service, though none was disrupted
@@FIX `s 427 illus (c), the power station` : Mischief Facts < `a mischief`
which he knows is likely
to the provision of any key service
@@END
#ASSERT `offence under s 427` `s 427 illus (c), the power station`
#ASSERT NOT `offence under s 427` `a mischief`

